</ul>

<hr>

<h1>What Should Be Inside the &lt;body&gt; Tag?</h1>

<ul>
    <li>Headings</li>
    <li>Paragraphs</li>
    <li>Tables</li>
    <li>Lists</li>
    <li>Forms</li>
    <li>Anchor Tags</li>
